  m_text: '<size=36>FRANKS REVENGE</size>



    A game by

    Lanny MacMillan

    & Mike



    Starring

    Frank ..... as himself



    <color=#8fd16a>MUSIC</color>

    CHAOS - a collection of music

    Lost In Misery

    Buried In The Noise

